SUMMARY:Princeton in Africa Fellowship - Application Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Princeton in Africa matches talented and passionate college g
 raduates (and graduating students) with organizations working across Afr
 ica for year-long service placements. Placements in countries such as Bo
 tswana\, Côte d’Ivoire\, Eswatini\, Ghana\, Kenya\, Rwanda\, Sierra L
 eone\, South Africa\, Tanzania\, Uganda and Zimbabwe. Posts with organiz
 ations such as the African Leadership Academy\, Botswana Baylor Children
 's Clinical Centre of Excellence\, International Rescue Committee\, Farm
 ing Out of Poverty (FOOP)\, Lwala Community Alliance\, Tech Care for All
  and WARC. Please see the FAQs section (https://www.princetoninafrica.or
 g/applicants/frequently-asked-questions/) on the Princeton in Africa Pro
 gram website before applying. Apply by October 26\, 2026.\nhttps://caree
 rdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/princeton-africa-fellowship-applicatio
 n-deadline
URL:https://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/princeton-africa-fello
 wship-application-deadline
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
