SUMMARY:Get to know Visa
LOCATION:Julis Romo Rabinowitz Building A17
DESCRIPTION:Join Visa's Early Careers team to learn how they're shaping t
 he future of digital payments and commerce around the world. During this
  session\, students will gain insights into Visa's mission culture and t
 he innovative work driving the global payments ecosystem. The Visa team 
 will share information about internship and full-time opportunities\, di
 scuss career paths within technology\, business and corporate functions 
 and provide tips for navigating the recruiting process. Students will ha
 ve the opportunity to hear from Visa professionals about their experienc
 es and ask questions during an interactive Q&A. Whether interested in te
 chnology\, product\, data analytics\, cybersecurity\, finance\, consulti
 ng\, or business operations\, attend and learn how you can build your ca
 reer with Visa.\nRegister: https://princeton.joinhandshake.com/edu/event
 s/2017279\nhttps://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/get-know-visa
URL:https://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/get-know-visa
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
