SUMMARY:JPMorganChase Markets and Investment Banking
LOCATION:Robertson Hall 100
DESCRIPTION:The JPMorgan Markets and Investment Banking Recruitment Teams
  for Princeton are visiting campus to engage with freshmen and sophomore
 s. As part of this event\, the JPMorgan team will share invaluable infor
 mation and guidance about the internship opportunities for students in a
 dvance of applications opening in January 2026. Elizabeth Myers '92\, Gl
 obal Chairman of Investment Banking and Capital Markets\, will provide o
 pening remarks. The informational session will be followed by an opportu
 nity to network with current JPMorgan employees across Markets and Inves
 tment Banking that are Princeton alumni.\nRegister: https://princeton.jo
 inhandshake.com/edu/events/2022116\nhttps://careerdevelopment.princeton.
 edu/events/jpmorganchase-markets-and-investment-banking
URL:https://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/jpmorganchase-markets-
 and-investment-banking
