SUMMARY:VISA Coffee Chats - Sophomores and Juniors
LOCATION:36 University Place\, Suite 300
DESCRIPTION:Join Visa for an interactive resume workshop and coffee chats
  designed to help students strengthen their resumes and learn more about
  career opportunities at Visa. Visa employees will share practical resum
 e tips and offer individualized guidance\, while coffee chats will give 
 students an opportunity to ask questions and gain insights into Visa\, o
 ur teams\, and the recruiting process. Rising juniors and seniors are th
 e primary audience\, but all students are welcome to participate.\nRegis
 ter: https://princeton.joinhandshake.com/jobs/11556341\nhttps://careerde
 velopment.princeton.edu/events/visa-coffee-chats-sophomores-and-juniors
