SUMMARY:Ph.D. Coffee Chat Day
DESCRIPTION:Coffee chats are an opportunity to meet one-on-one with an em
 ployer and to ask questions about their organization\, career paths\, ap
 plications/recruiting or any other professional topic. While it is not a
  formal recruiting program\, it does provide a chance to explore career 
 options and start to develop a network. Registration for coffee chats co
 ntinues until all slots with employers are filled. Participating employe
 rs (additional employers will be added): - CNA (https://princeton.joinha
 ndshake.com/edu/employers/31675) (Government/Defense\, Social Impact) - 
 SRI International (https://app.joinhandshake.com/edu/employers/16327) (R
 esearch\, Social Impact) Students need to upload a resume visible to emp
 loyers (https://support.joinhandshake.com/hc/en-us/articles/218692648-Ho
 w-to-Upload-a-New-Document) before registering for a coffee chat. If you
  want assistance updating your resume before the cof\nRegister: https://
 princeton.joinhandshake.com/edu/events/2009761/overview\nhttps://careerd
 evelopment.princeton.edu/events/phd-coffee-chat-day
URL:https://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/phd-coffee-chat-day
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
