SUMMARY:Science & Technology Job Fair
LOCATION:Dillon Gym
DESCRIPTION:The Science and Technology Job Fair brings together Princeton
  students and employers for networking\, recruiting\, and career convers
 ations. You will have the opportunity to meet with organizations interes
 ted in recruiting for full-time employment and summer internships. All e
 nrolled undergraduate and graduate students at Princeton University are 
 welcome. Attend the prep session (https://princeton.joinhandshake.com/ed
 u/events/1979378) on Oct. 27 to learn how to: - Find employers with inte
 rnships and jobs that interest you - Research employers before the day o
 f the fair - Dress for success - Network with prospective employers and 
 Princeton alumni - Introduce yourself and follow-up with employers\nRegi
 ster: https://princeton.joinhandshake.com/edu/career_fairs/65746\nhttps:
 //careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/science-technology-job-fair-2
